<!-- docx4j-python CR-001 section 8: the part warm_up() parses so that the
     XmlContext has built the metadata of the classes a real document touches
     before the first real document arrives. Hand written, deliberately small,
     and deliberately varied: paragraph and run properties, a style reference,
     a hyperlink, a field, a bookmark, a tracked insertion and deletion, a
     table with a grid, a drawing, w14 attributes, an mc:AlternateContent, a
